## [:< ##

# name  = editor.control.list.window_cap
# descr = max visible/reserved rows for one list field

## the single number that makes a capped list field's height IDENTICAL across
## every rendering of it -- collapsed reservation
## [  user-edit.form.build_frame ], the expanded window itself
## [  editor.control.list.expand ], and the scroll step size
## [  editor.control.list.scroll ] all read this rather than carrying their
## own copy, for the same reason editor.control.list.summary is factored out :
## three implementations of one number would drift, and the drift would show
## up as a frame that jumps on PgUp/PgDn instead of one that never moves.
##
## fixed, not per-field : a field's entry count decides WHETHER it windows
## [ more than this many entries ], not how big the window is

return 3;

